
Welcome to the MorvaneOS live system.

Connect to the internet (wired connections work automatically):
  iwctl
  [iwd]# device list
  [iwd]# station wlan0 scan
  [iwd]# station wlan0 get-networks
  [iwd]# station wlan0 connect "Network name"
  [iwd]# exit

Check you're online:
  ping -c 3 morvane.doughmination.gay

Then install MorvaneOS:
  morvane-install

